### Every request of this training example - run them one by one with the green arrow in Rider/VS Code.
@host = http://localhost:5080

### ----- Overview -----
GET {{host}}/

### The generated OpenAPI document (development only)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### ----- CRUD on /api/books -----
### READ (list): default order by id
GET {{host}}/api/books

### READ (list): sorted by title - picks the keyed service "title"
GET {{host}}/api/books?sortBy=title

### READ (list): sorted by year, two entries per page
GET {{host}}/api/books?sortBy=year&page=1&pageSize=2

### READ (list): invalid query parameters -> 400 from the validation filter
GET {{host}}/api/books?sortBy=publisher&page=0&pageSize=9999

### READ (single)
GET {{host}}/api/books/1

### READ: unknown id -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/books/999

### HEAD: only checks existence, without a body
HEAD {{host}}/api/books/1

### CREATE -> 201 with a Location header
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Der Richter und sein Henker",
  "author": "Friedrich Dürrenmatt",
  "year": 1950
}

### CREATE: duplicate -> 400 (domain rule with store access)
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "der richter und sein henker",
  "author": "Friedrich Dürrenmatt",
  "year": 1950
}

### CREATE: invalid data -> 400 with problem details
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "",
  "year": 1000
}

### UPDATE (complete)
PUT {{host}}/api/books/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Der Verdacht",
  "author": "Friedrich Dürrenmatt",
  "year": 1951
}

### UPDATE (single field)
PATCH {{host}}/api/books/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 1952
}

### PATCH without a change -> 400
PATCH {{host}}/api/books/4
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### DELETE -> 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/books/4

### DELETE the same id again -> 404
DELETE {{host}}/api/books/4

### OPTIONS: allowed methods in the Allow header
OPTIONS {{host}}/api/books

### ----- Diagnostics: dependency injection you can touch -----
### Compare the lifetimes - call it twice and compare the ids!
GET {{host}}/api/diagnostics/lifetimes

### The audit trail of the running request (scoped service across middleware and endpoint)
GET {{host}}/api/diagnostics/audit

### Deliberate failure -> 500 as problem details
GET {{host}}/api/diagnostics/boom
